# What a Docker build of this repo never needs. Above all: no secrets (.env) and no host
# node_modules (they're reinstalled inside the image for its own platform).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
graphify-out
specs
docs
.specify
.claude
.agents
.compliance
**/*.log
